# VidStream Client Environment Variables

# Option A (Recommended for Vercel):
# Leave these unset on Vercel to use the same-origin rewrites defined in vercel.json.
# This ensures that the HTTP-only refresh token cookie is treated as a first-party cookie,
# preventing browser third-party cookie blocking (Safari ITP / Chrome / Firefox).

# Option B (Direct Cross-Origin):
# If you prefer not using Vercel rewrites, configure these variables in Vercel Project Settings:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://vidstream-api.onrender.com/api
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://vidstream-api.onrender.com
